      <figcaption id="fig-1-cap"><span class="fig__no">Fig.&nbsp;1</span> — Four PYNQ-Z2 boards, one subsystem each, talking over UART; the actuator drives two PWM channels, one for frequency and one for amplitude.</figcaption>
